OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe superstar tech boss - who is Jensen
OL,4,AHuang?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is known as a workaholic and a
OL,7,Fdemanding manager, with high standards
OL,8,Ffor those who worked for him, which
OL,9,Fincluded his own children, promoted
OL,10,Fwithin the company. But he has seen his
OL,11,Fpersonal reputation go into free fall
OL,12,Fthis week, undone by romantic
OL,13,Fentanglements, that throw doubt on his
OL,14,Ffocus and his judgement.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
